[{"id":2998475705,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yuRu5","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Cc @Ivorforce \r\n\r\nThis looks a bit suspicious to me. Resize calls reserve internally. So the actually memory allocated should be the same in either case. \r\n\r\nIs the problem perhaps coming from whether the object is initialized or not? \r\n\r\nOr is the problem simpler and is caused by reading `size()` later on?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-2998475705","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-2998475705"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-08T17:09:24Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2998566706,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6yun8y","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yes @clayjohn, I also don't think this is the right fix. While `reserve` hopes to allocate the requested elements, it is not guaranteed that the allocation actually happens. While it will probably work in the current state of the code, relying on `reserve` for padding makes me uneasy. \r\n\r\n> Or is the problem simpler and is caused by reading size() later on? \r\n\r\nThis was my gut feeling as well, so I checked. Indeed, it's what's happening:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88/modules/raycast/raycast_occlusion_cull.cpp#L467\r\n\r\nThe 3 floats of padding are passed as a single additional vertex, causing there to be no practical padding at all. Asan is right to complain.\r\nA better fix might be to subtract one on the linked `size()` argument, referring to the above code.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-2998566706","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-2998566706"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-08T17:39:16Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3008754096,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6zVfGw","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?u=379f47422d5025b37eb87bdcaa6e1cc3927edfed&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-3008754096","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107006#pullrequestreview-3008754096"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107006"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-11T06:10:23Z","commit_id":null}]